     A                                      CUSTOMER BALANCE MASTER FILE
     A                                      REF(BALA981/QDDSSRC)
     A          R BALAR                     CUSTOMER BALANCE RECORD
     A            CUSTNO         7S 0       CUSTOMER NUMBER
     A            CUSTNAME      30A         CUSTOMER NAME
     A            BALAMT        11S 2       CURRENT BALANCE AMOUNT
     A            CREDLMT       11S 2       CREDIT LIMIT
     A            LASTUPD        8S 0       LAST UPDATE DATE (YYYYMMDD)
     A            LASTUSR       10A         LAST UPDATED BY USER
     A            STATUS         1A         RECORD STATUS (A=ACTIVE C=CLOSED)
     A          K CUSTNO
